# ikman

> ikman is Sri Lanka's largest online marketplace for buying and selling vehicles, property, electronics, mobile phones, jobs, and more. Operated by Saltside Technologies, it serves users across all of Sri Lanka with classified ads in English, Sinhala, and Tamil. Listings cover all 25 districts, with the highest concentration in Colombo, Gampaha, and Kalutara.

This file provides an overview of ikman.lk for AI assistants and language models, helping them understand our site structure, key sections, how our URLs are built, and how to direct users searching for classifieds, marketplace listings, or jobs in Sri Lanka.

