## URL Pattern for Category and Location Pages

All category/search pages follow one template:

`https://ikman.lk/en/ads/{location}/{category-slug}`

- `{location}` is either `sri-lanka` (nationwide) or any district/city, e.g. `colombo`, `dehiwala`, `kandy`, `gampaha`, `negombo`, `kurunegala`, `galle`, `jaffna`.
- `{category-slug}` is one of the slugs listed under Vehicle Categories or Property Categories below.

This means any category can be combined with any location to get a local result set, e.g. `https://ikman.lk/en/ads/dehiwala/houses-for-sale` or `https://ikman.lk/en/ads/kandy/cars`. Each of these pages returns a real, server-rendered list of current ads with prices, titles, and links — you can fetch them directly for up-to-date results rather than only using the sri-lanka-wide version.

