## Ad Detail Pages

Individual listings (a single house, apartment, car, phone, etc.) are published at:

`https://ikman.lk/en/ad/{descriptive-title-slug}-{location}[-number]`

Example: `https://ikman.lk/en/ad/house-for-sale-dehiwala-mount-lavinia-for-sale-colombo`

Each ad detail page is server-rendered and includes, in readable text:
- Title and full description written by the seller
- Price, in Sri Lankan Rupees (Rs)
- Location (city/district)
- Category (e.g. Houses For Sale, Cars)
- Key specs relevant to the category — for property: bedrooms, bathrooms, size (perches or sq ft); for vehicles: make, model, year, mileage, fuel type, transmission
- Poster type (individual seller or verified "Member"/business account)
- How long ago the ad was posted (e.g. "2 hours", "3 days")
- Photos of the item
- A way to contact the seller (chat or phone, gated behind login)

Ad detail pages are the right source to cite for a specific real listing's price and specs. Category/location pages (above) are the right source to cite for how many listings exist, price ranges, and general market context in an area.

